<title>UK: MOTOR RACING-LOLA SIGN ROSSET AND SOSPIRI.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-LOLA SIGN ROSSET AND SOSPIRI.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Lola Formula One team named Brazilian Ricardo Rosset and Italian Vincenzo Sospiri on Tuesday to drive their Grand Prix cars next season.</p>
<p>Rosset drove for the Footwork team in 1996, finishing eight grands prix, while Sospiri won the 1995 Formula 3000 title and was the official test driver for Benetton this year.</p>
<p>Lola commercial director Stephen Taylor said: &quot;The team had identified both Ricardo and Vincenzo as being an ideal combination of experience with current Formula One cars and hunger for Grand Prix points.&quot;</p>
</text>
